{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415734","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415734","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1041573401:1":{"text":"晚上好，女士。这里难得有空位，介意与我分享这张桌子吗？","source_cn":"晚上好，女士。这里难得有空位，介意与我分享这张桌子吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DE39BDF57866A16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041573402:1":{"text":"看你的铠甲和姿态，是位身经百战的骑士？","source_cn":"看你的铠甲和姿态，是位身经百战的骑士？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x755E1AD5AAFD299E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041573403:1":{"text":"坐吧。骑士，那是两千年前我的身份了。","source_cn":"坐吧。骑士，那是两千年前我的身份了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A446EDFBB363D1C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041573404:1":{"text":"你的观察很敏锐，你身上，同样具有骑士的气息。","source_cn":"你的观察很敏锐，你身上，同样具有骑士的气息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACF89E8AEEABBEF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041573405:1":{"text":"呵呵，你的眼光更为准确。我出身于格伦沃顿家族，我叫休。","source_cn":"呵呵，你的眼光更为准确。我出身于格伦沃顿家族，我叫休。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7348EB2DB2D22B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041573406:1":{"text":"格伦沃顿……亚利斯塔·格伦沃顿的后人？","source_cn":"格伦沃顿……亚利斯塔·格伦沃顿的后人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29359A89FCB2021F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041573407:1":{"text":"您听说过先祖？！是的，他曾在第一次神魔战争中守护帝国！","source_cn":"您听说过先祖？！是的，他曾在第一次神魔战争中守护帝国！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD51EAC4A7FA4538","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041573408:1":{"text":"但现在……我走在成为魔法师的道路上……","source_cn":"但现在……我走在成为魔法师的道路上……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6FDC8B73AF2E1FA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041573409:1":{"text":"放弃铠甲剑鞘，选择法杖？","source_cn":"放弃铠甲剑鞘，选择法杖？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1DF7D02CDD352FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041573410:1":{"text":"复兴一个只剩空壳的家族，需要更直接的力量和关注度。","source_cn":"复兴一个只剩空壳的家族，需要更直接的力量和关注度。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8064160A31D42E81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041573411:1":{"text":"选择魔法是更现实的路。","source_cn":"选择魔法是更现实的路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1616BA98E1CE2EF0","variant_s